{
  "_comment": [
    "Supplier taxonomy -> OnlyParts leaf category + HSN code.",
    "",
    "This file is the whole point of the exercise and the only part a scraper",
    "cannot produce. Neither robu.in nor onlyscrews.in publishes an HSN code,",
    "and neither one's category tree is ours. A row whose source category is",
    "not listed here comes out of the puller with blank `category` and `hsn`",
    "cells, which the importer's dry run reports as an error rather than",
    "silently filing the part in the wrong drawer.",
    "",
    "Match is longest-prefix, case-insensitive, on the source's breadcrumb",
    "(robu) or product_type/tags (Shopify). Add rows as you meet them.",
    "",
    "!! HSN CODES BELOW ARE PLACEHOLDERS AND MUST BE CONFIRMED BY YOUR CA !!",
    "",
    "They are the plausible eight-digit code for the *typical* item in each",
    "drawer, which is not the same as the correct code for any given part. The",
    "GST rate follows the code, so a wrong one is a filing error rather than a",
    "cosmetic one — and one code per drawer is too coarse for real invoicing:",
    "a drawer like `tools` legitimately spans several headings. Treat this as",
    "the scaffold that gets rows through the importer during setup, and replace",
    "it with per-category codes before you invoice anybody."
  ],
