    "_comment_robu_taxonomy": [
      "Everything below the divider was added after the full robu crawl, which",
      "left 43,631 of 107,509 rows unmapped across 664 distinct supplier",
      "categories. robu names its taxonomy by function ('Buffers and",
      "Transceivers IC') where ours names it by part family, so these are",
      "translations rather than synonyms.",
      "",
      "Keys are matched longest-first as whole words, so a specific key can sit",
      "beside a generic one: 'limit switch' resolves before 'switch'. Adding a",
      "short generic key is the risky move — check it against titles, not just",
      "category names, because titles are the fallback.",
      "",
      "Verify every target with scratchpad leaves.mjs: a path that is not in the",
      "taxonomy imports as an uncategorised product, silently."
    ],
