  "_comment_priority": "Keys that win regardless of length. Longest-wins cannot express \"this narrow token outranks that broad noun\", and stretching a key until it happens to be longer is how you get a table nobody can reason about. Keep this list tiny and only add a token that is unambiguous on its own in every row it touches — measure before adding, the way rp-sma was measured and rejected."
}
